.Dd November 26, 2026
.Dt RETICULUM-GO-ID 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm reticulum-go-id , rgoid
.Nd manage Reticulum identities and signed artifacts
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm reticulum-go Cm id
.Op Fl i Ar path
.Op Fl g Ar path
.Op Fl p
.Op Fl s Ar file
.Op Fl V Ar path
.Op Fl e Ar file
.Op Fl d Ar file
.Op Ar ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
Generate and inspect identities, compute destination hashes, and create or
verify
.Pa .rsg , .rsm ,
and
.Pa .rfe
artifacts.
.Sh FLAG PARSING
Flags may appear before, between, or after positional arguments. A literal
.Cm --
ends flag parsing.
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width "--extract"
.It Fl p
Print the identity hash and key summary. With
.Fl json ,
print one JSON object containing plain hexadecimal identity and public_key fields.
.It Fl P
Allow private key material in output. In JSON mode, private_key is present only
when this flag is set.
.It Fl H Ar aspects
Print the destination hash for a dotted aspects name.
.It Fl w Ar path
Write output to a path instead of standard output where the operation supports it.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr reticulum-go 1
.Sh AUTHORS
.An Quad4.io
